and the network at upload time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"first","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"code":"second","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as "},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" adds "},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead."}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") enricher calls for a batch of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" records.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/enriched(by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that keeps th